    "url": "/region/sicily/#era-1861",
    "why": "Garibaldi landed at Marsala 11 May 1860, proclaimed himself Dictator of Sicily 7 Jul 1860 in Victor Emmanuel's name, conquest complete 1 Aug 1860 (Syracuse, Augusta, Milazzo); plebiscite 21 Oct 1860, annexation 17 Dec 1860, Kingdom of Italy 17 Mar 1861. Allied military government (AMGOT) ran Sicily from 10 Jul 1943 and handed administration to the Badoglio cabinet in Feb 1944, but Italian sovereignty was not transferred, so not treated as contested."
